https://www.danmurphys.com.au/product/DM_ER_2000003981_PSCSB23/pertaringa-adelaide-scarecrow-sauvignon-blanc-2023?isFromSearch=false&isPersonalised=false&pageName=category_page,Adelaide Scarecrow Sauvignon Blanc 2023,"Each vintage, the Sauvignon Blanc grapes are the first grapes to ripen in the vineyard. The scarecrow is still used as an effective deterrent to the local grape-loving birds and has also lent its name to our famous Sauvignon Blanc.
